045,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81045?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny","html_url":"https://github.com/lunny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"milestoned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-11-21T15:17:49Z","milestone":{"title":"1.10.1"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/557823374","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/9066#issuecomment-557823374","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/9066","id":557823374,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1NzgyMzM3NA==","user":{"login":"blueworrybear","id":1456219,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTYyMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1456219?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear","html_url":"https://github.com/blueworrybear","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-23T18:53:17Z","updated_at":"2019-11-23T18:54:55Z","body":"It seems to me that it's because external account sign in currently requires password.\r\nLooking at the router:\r\n>routers.go:306\r\n```go\r\nm.Post(\"/link_account_signin\", bindIgnErr(auth.SignInForm{}), user.LinkAccountPostSignIn)\r\n```\r\n`LinkAccountPostSignIn` binds with `auth.SignInForm`, which force password must exist with `binding:\"Required;MaxSize(255)\"`.\r\n```go\r\ntype SignInForm struct {\r\n\tUserName string `binding:\"Required;MaxSize(254)\"`\r\n\t// TODO remove required from password for SecondFactorAuthentication\r\n\tPassword string `binding:\"Required;MaxSize(255)\"`\r\n\tRemember bool\r\n}\r\n```\r\nAs the result, `LinkAccountPostSignIn` always redirects to register new account due to the context error:\r\n```go\r\nfunc LinkAccountPostSignIn(ctx *context.Context, signInForm auth.SignInForm) {\r\n// ...\r\n\tif ctx.HasError() {\r\n\t\tctx.HTML(200, tplLinkAccount)\r\n\t\treturn\r\n\t}\r\n//...\r\n```\r\n> The context error flag is set in `modules/auth/auth.go:112`, function `validate`\r\n\r\nThe possible solution may be creating a new `ExternalSignInForm` and make `Password` optional. But it requires to check `Password` field within `LinkAccountPostSignIn`.\r\n\r\nLet me know if this is an acceptable solution. I could create a PR to solve this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/557823374/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"blueworrybear","id":1456219,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTYyMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1456219?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear","html_url":"https://github.com/blueworrybear","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/557826233","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/9066#issuecomment-557826233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/9066","id":557826233,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1NzgyNjIzMw==","user":{"login":"BaxAndrei","id":12484505,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDg0NTA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12484505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei","html_url":"https://github.com/BaxAndrei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-23T19:31:07Z","updated_at":"2019-11-23T19:31:07Z","body":"But don't you think that if you eliminate the need to request the password for verification when connecting with oAuth2, users may abuse to acquire accounts that do not belong to them?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/557826233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"BaxAndrei","id":12484505,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDg0NTA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12484505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei","html_url":"https://github.com/BaxAndrei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaxAndrei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/557853986","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/9066#issuecomment-557853986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/9066","id":557853986,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1Nzg1Mzk4Ng==","user":{"login":"blueworrybear","id":1456219,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTYyMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1456219?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear","html_url":"https://github.com/blueworrybear","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueworrybear/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-24T03:24:01Z","updated_at":"2019-11-24T03:25:21Z","body":"> But don't you think that if you eliminate the need to request the password for verification when connecting with oAuth2, users may abuse to acquire accounts that do not belong to them?\r\n\r\nYou are right. The problem is Gitea removes **Password** form field if you set [app.ini](https://docs.gitea.io/en-us/config-cheat-sheet/) `REQUIRE_EXTERNAL_REGISTRATION_PASSWORD = false`. Both **Register New Account** and **Link to Existing Account** use `REQUIRE_EXTERNAL_REGISTRATION_PASSWORD`  to decide whether to show **Password** field. It seems to me that it's confused. IMO, we should always check user's password when linking to existing account.\r\n\r\nSo the other solution would be always showing **Password** field on **Link to Existing Account** tab. However, this solution conflicts with what #6606 wants to do. I am not sure if it's acceptable. 😕 \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactio