ull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/pulls/9147","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/9147","diff_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/9147.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/9147.patch","merged_at":"2019-11-24T20:17:54Z"},"body":"This PR is to fix #9066 and #8923 . Since the **Password** field will be disable by `REQUIRE_EXTERNAL_REGISTRATION_PASSWORD = false` in `app.ini`, there is noway for user to link external account since `func LinkAccountPostSignIn` bind with `SignInForm`. The detail is descried as below.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n>routers.go:306\r\n```go\r\nm.Post(\"/link_account_signin\", bindIgnErr(auth.SignInForm{}), user.LinkAccountPostSignIn)\r\n```\r\n`LinkAccountPostSignIn` binds with `auth.SignInForm`, which force password must exist with `binding:\"Required;MaxSize(255)\"`.\r\n```go\r\ntype SignInForm struct {\r\n\tUserName string `binding:\"Required;MaxSize(254)\"`\r\n\t// TODO remove required from password for SecondFactorAuthentication\r\n\tPassword string `binding:\"Required;MaxSize(255)\"`\r\n\tRemember bool\r\n}\r\n```\r\nAs the result, `LinkAccountPostSignIn` always redirects to register new account due to the context error:\r\n```go\r\nfunc LinkAccountPostSignIn(ctx *context.Context, signInForm auth.SignInForm) {\r\n// ...\r\n\tif ctx.HasError() {\r\n\t\tctx.HTML(200, tplLinkAccount)\r\n\t\treturn\r\n\t}\r\n//...\r\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/9147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/9147/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2826199932,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MjgyNjE5OTkzMg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/events/2826199932","actor":{"login":"techknowlogick","id":164197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDE5Nw==